1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,000
In February 1945, RAF Bomber Command and the US Eighth Air Force bombed Dresden.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:08,000
Up to 25,000 people were killed, according to the city's historians' commission.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:11,000
Historians still argue about whether the raid was necessary.
